      "title": "Viking re-enactor prepares to walk 100 miles in Viking clothing",
      "summary": "After the lose of his teacher viking re-enactor Ryan has decided to walk 100 miles in Viking clothing in her memory",
      "body": "Up Next. Helicopters dump water as huge Norway fire destroys homes. Video, 00:00:51SubsectionEuropePublished18 hours agoDonning protective kit for a first glance at the Bayeux Tapestry. Video, 00:01:09SubsectionCulturePublished1 day agoBodycam footage shows airlift of girl stranded by Texas floods. Video, 00:00:49SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished1 day agoWatch: What to know as Genoa bridge disaster trial ends. Video, 00:01:16SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoStarmer given Order of Freedom medal in final Ukraine trip as PM. Video, 00:01:05SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoMoment US Navy jet stuns packed Florida beach with low flypast. Video, 00:00:23SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoDramatic video shows wildfire surround freight train in Canada. Video, 00:00:38SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days agoWatch: TikTok legend Gangster Granny on her love for Messi. Video, 00:00:46SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished3 days agoArgentina fans celebrate World Cup win over England. Video, 00:01:14SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished3 days agoWhat if Bluey spoke one of the world's oldest living languages? Video, 00:01:13SubsectionAustraliaPublished3 days agoWatch: Starmer's kind send-off across the Commons in final PMQs. Video, 00:01:32SubsectionPoliticsPublished3 days ago",
