nReallocate memory using the allocator set by mjb_set_memory_functions. If no allocator is set, the default allocator is used.\nchar *larger = (char*)mjb_realloc(buffer, 32);\nFree memory using the allocator set by mjb_set_memory_functions. If no allocator is set, the default allocator is used.",
