      "summary": "Argentina scored two late goals to secure their spot in the final against Spain.",
      "body": "Up Next. Watch: TikTok legend Gangster Granny on her love for Messi. Video, 00:00:46SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished4 hours agoArgentina fans celebrate World Cup win over England. Video, 00:00:55SubsectionLatin AmericaPublished3 hours agoWhat if Bluey spoke one of the world's oldest living languages? Video, 00:01:13SubsectionAustraliaPublished7 hours agoWatch: Starmer's kind send-off across the Commons in final PMQs. Video, 00:01:32SubsectionPoliticsPublished10 hours agoWatch: The clash between US and Iran for control of the Strait of Hormuz. Video, 00:01:42SubsectionWorldPublished1 day agoWife describes moment husband nearly sucked out of Ryanair plane. Video, 00:00:27SubsectionEuropePublished1 day agoWatch: Horses evacuated as fire approaches riding centre near Paris. Video, 00:00:41SubsectionEuropePublished2 days agoPeople flee Bangkok bar as huge flames shoot out from doorway. Video, 00:00:58SubsectionAsiaPublished2 days ago'This landscape is completely charred': Inside the village at epicentre of Spain's wildfires. Video, 00:01:31SubsectionEuropePublished3 days agoPeople flee as Russian strike hits near Ukraine coffee shop. Video, 00:00:52SubsectionEuropePublished3 days ago'We escaped Spanish wildfire, but our friends lost their lives' Video, 00:01:27SubsectionEuropePublished4 days ago",
