      "title": "Show HN: ContextVault – Shared memory layer for your AI and your team",
      "summary": "Hi HN,\nI'm Kevin. I built ContextVault because I kept running into the same problem with AI tools.\nEvery project accumulated prompts, coding conventions, architectural decisions, examples, and other pieces of context that made the models significantly more useful. The problem was that this information quickly became fragmented. Some lived in ChatGPT Projects, some in Claude, some in Markdown files",
      "body": "The shared memory layer for your AI and your team.Stop your team from starting from scratch with every AI session.Get accessRead the docsArchitectureOne vault.Every agent in sync.A single source of truth that your AI clients read from and write to. Scoped per user, per agent, per tenant, and durable across sessions. Stop worrying about scattered Markdown files or out of date local projects.Share memories across your organization, foreverReduce overall context load of every AI requestStop managing mountains of scattered Markdown files across projectsBring your own AI client, no vendor lock inSingle sign on through major providersSupportWhy teams rely on ContextVaultFully featured, close the gaps, skill-up your teams.EcosystemWorks with your favorite AI clients and editorsBring your favorite AI client, no vendor lock-in here.ProductTurn good answers intoreusable knowledgeDurable memory, shared across every AI client your team uses.Persistent memoryMemories stay durable across sessions, agents, and model vendors.Hybrid retrievalVector and full-text ranking in one query, tuned for code and ops recall.Works with your AI clientsConnect Claude, Codex, ChatGPT, and any MCP-compatible client to the same shared memory layer.Group-scoped accessKeep memories visible to the right team, department, or project group without leaking context everywhere.Access-controlled memoryUser, group, and organization scoping with audit trails and database-level isolation.Context that survives sessionsCarry important decisions, fixes, preferences, and lessons forward even when chats, projects, or tools reset.PricingPriced to scale with your teamStart with a time-limited trial, then upgrade to meet your needs.Free trial1 seatSingle default group50 memories to test the workflowCore MCP and API accessStart trialSolo1 seatSingle default group500 memoriesFull MCP and API accessBuilt for one operator, consultant, or founderStart soloMost PopularTeam10 seats15 groups2,500 memories15,000 monthly queriesMember management and workspace controlsShared memory collections across your organizationStart with your teamEnterprise20 seatsUnlimited groupsUnlimited memoriesUnlimited monthly queriesData exportProcurement, onboarding, and security review supportTalk to salesFAQAnswers before you have to askShort answers about how ContextVault works.Give your AI a memory it deservesStart storing shared memories today. Private beta, free to start.Get accessRead the docs",
